det.onnx is PP-OCRv6_tiny_det as distributed. rec.onnx is a fine-tune of
PP-OCRv6_tiny_rec with a replaced Thai classifier, trained by iApp.

judge9.onnx (2.2.1) was trained from scratch by iApp and is Apache-2.0.

The optional dewarping (runtime/dewarp.py, 2.2) uses two Apache-2.0 models:
  - dewarp/dewarp_mask.onnx (included): the page mask of the MonkeyOCRv2 document preprocessor,
    exported to ONNX by iApp from preprocessor1.pth in https://huggingface.co/zenosai/MonkeyOCRv2-S-Parsing
    (code: https://github.com/Yuliang-Liu/MonkeyOCRv2). Copyright the MonkeyOCRv2 authors.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  - PaddlePaddle UVDoc (https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/UVDoc_onnx): not included, downloaded separately.
